<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Uniphone 6-mth net down 70 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Uniphone 6-mth net down 70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		4.81	  vs	  15.29</p>
<p>    Turnover		245.38	  vs	 231.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  9.71	  vs	  27.97</p>
<p>    Minorities     less   0.63	  vs  less   4.23</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)   3.30	  vs	  10.95</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Uniphone Telecommunications Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
